<title>POLAND: BPH to vote on $100 mln eurobond Jan 14.</title>
<headline>BPH to vote on $100 mln eurobond Jan 14.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Poland's Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA will vote on January 14 on a planned $100 million convertible eurobond issue, BPH's management board said in a statement on Monday.</p>
</text>
